<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US" dir="ltr"><head><title>Vintage Story Game Account</title>
<head>
	<link rel="shortcut icon" href="public/images/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">

	<link href="/public/css/vintagestory.css?version=2" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
	
	<script type="text/javascript" src="/public/js/jquery-3.1.0.min.js"></script>
	<script src="https://www.recaptcha.net/recaptcha/api.js"></script>
</head>

<body>

<div class="top">
	<div class="logoimg">
		<a href="/">
			<img src="/public/images/logo.png" style="width:406px;">
		</a>
	</div>
	<div class="titleRight">
		Client Area
	</div>
</div>

<div class="content">

	<div class="menuBar">
		<div class="menuItem"><a href="https://www.vintagestory.at/">Back to Main site</a></div>
									</div>
	
	<div class="innercontent">
				
		<p>Log in here with your game account to download the game. The game account is separate from your forum account.</p>
		
		<form method="post" action="attemptlogin">
			<input type="hidden" name="loginredir" value="">

						
				
				<div class="inputname">
					E-Mail Address
				</div>
				<div class="input">
					<input type="text" name="email" value="" autofocus>
				</div>

				<div class="inputname">
					Password
				</div>
				<div class="input">
					<input type="password" name="password">
				</div>

				
						
							<p><div class="g-recaptcha" data-sitekey="6LfGqigTAAAAAJmnh3kR1UGpdoJE7PsLLNu8wE3n"></div></p>
						
			
			<div class="confirmbutton">
				<input type="submit" value="Sign In">
			</div>
		</form>
		
		<p>
			<br>
			<a href="https://account.vintagestory.at/requestresetpwd">Reset your password</a> | <a href="https://account.vintagestory.at/createaccount">Redeem a game key</a>
		</p>
		
		<p>
			<a href="#faq">Need Help?</a>
		</p>
		<div class="faq" style="display:none; border: 1px solid gray; padding: 5px; background-color:#eee;">
			<ul style="list-style-type:none; padding-left: 0px; padding-top:0px; margin-top:0px;">
				<li>
					<b>I can't log in</b><p>
					<ol style="padding-left:15px">
						<li><a href="https://www.vintagestory.at/store/category/1-game-account/">Purchase the game</a></li>
						<li>After purchase you'll receive an email titled 'Your Personal Vintage Story Game Key' that contains a link to create your game account. It might be in your Spam folder.</li>
					</ol>
					</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<b>I can't log in anymore</b>
					<p>Use your login info from your game account, not your forum account.</p>
				</li>
				<li><b>I forgot my password</b><p>
					Use the <a href="/requestresetpwd">password reset form</a></p>
				</li>
				<li><b>Nothing helps. I cannot log in or I haven't received the game account email</b>
					<p>Please use our <a href="https://www.vintagestory.at/support/">support request system</a> to ask for further assistance.</p>
				</li>
				<li><b>I received a key, how do I redeem it?</b>
					<p>On the <a href="https://account.vintagestory.at/createaccount">create account</a> page.</p>
				</li>
				<li><b>I want the free version of the game</b><p>
					<a href="https://info.vintagestory.at/classic">Get it at info.vintagestory.at/classic</a>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>


		<script type="text/javascript">
			$(document).ready(function() {
				$("a[href='#faq']").click(function() {
					$("div.faq").toggle();
					return false;
				});
				
				if (window.location.hash == "#help") {
					$("div.faq").toggle();
					$("div.faq").css("border", "2px solid #2f3acf");
				}
				$("a[href='#toggleremove2fa']").click(function() {
					let toggle = $(".remove2fa");
					toggle.toggle();
					return false;
				});
				
			});
		</script>
	
	</div>
</div>

<ul class="footer">
    <li style="float:left;"></li>
	<li style="margin-left:10px;"><a href="https://www.vintagestory.at/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></li>
	<li><a rel="nofollow" href="mailto:office@anegostudios.com">Contact Us</a></li>
</ul>

</body>
</html>